    "body": "## What's Changed\n* Phase III: extract VM-level domain handlers; overhaul project docs by @tahuffman1s in https://github.com/tahuffman1s/Realms-Android/pull/1\n* Add comprehensive developer guide and scope Cursor rules by @tahuffman1s in https://github.com/tahuffman1s/Realms-Android/pull/2\n* Feat/infinite turns phase1 by @tahuffman1s in https://github.com/tahuffman1s/Realms-Android/pull/3\n* Feat/infinite turns phase2 by @tahuffman1s in https://github.com/tahuffman1s/Realms-Android/pull/4\n* feat(phase2): rest removal, per-save DB, prompt memory polish by @tahuffman1s in https://github.com/tahuffman1s/Realms-Android/pull/5\n* Feat/konami cheats by @tahuffman1s in https://github.com/tahuffman1s/Realms-Android/pull/6\n* Feat/tag system json envelope by @tahuffman1s in https://github.com/tahuffman1s/Realms-Android/pull/7\n* Harden envelope parsing; remove shop system by @tahuffman1s in https://github.com/tahuffman1s/Realms-Android/pull/8\n* Equipment effects, inventory slots, combat spell picker by @tahuffman1s in https://github.com/tahuffman1s/Realms-Android/pull/9\n* Equipment effects, inventory slots, envelope hardening, shop removal by @tahuffman1s in https://github.com/tahuffman1s/Realms-Android/pull/10\n\n## New Contributors\n* @tahuffman1s made their first contribution in https://github.com/tahuffman1s/Realms-Android/pull/1\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/tahuffman1s/Realms-Android/commits/v0.1.0-alpha.1",
